  id: tutorial_shop
  title: Shop
  body: 'Now that you have harvested 10 vegetables, you''ve unlocked the Shop. Press
    the "Open Shop" button in the bottom right to access the Shop.


    From the
    Shop, you can sell the crops you''ve harvested for some Money, and you can also
    buy items from the Shop using the Money you gained from selling crops.'
